      "en": "‘Six days shall work be done, but on the seventh day there shall be a holy day for you, a Sabbath of solemn rest to the LORD: whoever does any work in it shall be put to death.",
      "ko": "엿새 동안은 일하고 제 칠일은 너희에게 성일이니 여호와께 특별한 안식일이라 무릇 이날에 일하는 자를 죽일지니",
      "source_text_hash": "42d5b141a88b412cb14b38a93e74398372906534e06b705939c0809323f1f2e0",
      "translation_text_hash": "b19605c510c917bca0992e5ff20c1ff899a6189c30b489313ddc0a2700f7e856",
